Package: tdns
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: caching DNS server with encryption and network-wide policy
 TDNS is a caching DNS server with encrypted upstream support, network-wide
 domain filtering, split DNS, a management API, and an embedded web interface.
 .
 This package installs the static binary published by the matching upstream
 release tag; it does not rebuild TDNS from source.
